                    "content": "<p><strong>COMPLIMENTARY SHIPPING</strong>Each Eden Raine piece is handcrafted to order in about 2–3 weeks. Every order ships insured and signature-required via FedEx 2Day within the U.S. or DHL Express Worldwide (2–5 days, 50+ countries). FedEx Overnight is available at checkout for U.S. customers.<br/><br/><strong>60-DAY RETURNS & EXCHANGES</strong>We're confident you'll love your Eden Raine jewellery, but if it isn't exactly as you imagined, you have 60 days from the shipment date to return or exchange it, complimentary. No restocking fees. Items must be unworn, in original condition, with the Eden Raine silver tag attached.<br/><br/></p>",
